{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_025B50","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"虽说都是哥斯达黎加的森林，种类其实很多。并不全是所谓的热带雨林。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加确实靠近赤道，但山地也很多。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"也是。海拔每升高4000英尺，气温就会下降7℃以上。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":"AUX_LEADIN_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"低地分布着热带雨林，高地则是热带云雾林。另外，有旱季的地区是热带干旱林。大致可以分成这三种。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":138,"review_flag":"AUX_DRY_FOREST_AND_THREE_TYPES_RESTORED"}]}